           SET     WS-ROOM                       TO    2

           *> PS-ROOMS-SHOW: lets the picked room wear the accent; the others none.
           *> Uses:   WS-ROOM (set just above to 2, Bedroom).
           *> Result: Btn-Bed::Transparency = 0; Btn-Living, Btn-Kitchen, Btn-Dining and
           *>         Btn-Play::Transparency = 100. WS-ROOM is not changed.

